///| Native media probing, persistent MJPEG/PCM streaming, HLS playlist parsing, WAV parsing,
///| and MSE dual-track state management for Farview host.
///| 1:1 port of `src/page/media_stub.c` FFI and `src/page/media.mbt` core state/parsers.

